        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits the installation of an international submarine cable without a permit if the person does not have a permit under this Part authorising the installation of the cable in the place in which it is installed.",
